---------------------------- MODULE InnerModule ----------------------------
VARIABLES x, y, z

Init == 
    /\ x \in {1, 2, 3}
    /\ y \in {10, 20}
    /\ z \in {100, 200}

Next ==
    /\ x' = x + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<y, z>>

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_<<x, y, z>>

=============================================================================